msgid "The identity provider does not support the required S256 code challenge method for PKCE."
msgstr "De identiteitsprovider ondersteunt de vereiste S256-codecontrolemethode voor PKCE niet."

#: auth/OpenIDConnectClient.php:134
msgid "The authorization_endpoint is not available in the well-known data."
msgstr "Het authorization_endpoint is niet beschikbaar in de well-known data."

